        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The nary participation pattern. 
This pattern re-uses participation and situation patterns. It is extracted from DOLCE-UltraLite by partial clone of elements.</dcterms:description>
        <dcterms:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Nary Participation Pattern</dcterms:title>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK&apos;s quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x8; term declared x2;
- header: dcterms:title &quot;Nary Participation Pattern&quot; - the library&apos;s name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library&apos;s description of the pattern
Each change is listed under &quot;curated&quot; in the pattern&apos;s metadata.json in OntoBoard&apos;s pattern library.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The nary participation pattern. 
This pattern re-uses participation and situation patterns. It is extracted from DOLCE-UltraLite by partial clone of elements.</rdfs:comment>
